      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE MOSS (7) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Scored by 1.1 lengths last time (30.40) in a Free For All over 525m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. PAR EXCELLENCE (4) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 2 length third (30.53) in a Free For All at this track. Can improve sharply here. GENERAL FRANKY (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (26.02) last time in a Grade 5 H at Geelong. Has a strong winning record here. Got the money at his only try from this box. Worth following up. MONEY PALACE (8) collected a minor prize last start in a close contest - must be considered.",
